{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-09_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-09","title":"舊日之影","storyCode":"10-10","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fbf099ca2432781ca0cb886bb56cdba132495e2a6e5796bf817d7df4397ee606","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，大家這邊走！跟著火光，穿過這些煙霧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這是什麼東西？某種攪拌器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是覺得這種滑稽的工具能傷到一個薩卡茲雇傭兵嗎......倫蒂尼姆的小貓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用緊張。過來吧，到我身後來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位雇傭兵......雖然看起來不像好人，但她暫時站在我們這一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同一邊嗎？你最好還是懷疑懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W......假如你真想從我這裡得到任何消息，那麼你最好把自己變得更容易合作一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼也喜歡把威脅的話說得這麼彎彎繞繞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......你不會是凱爾希的私生女吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，仔細看了看，一點都不像。而且那個冷淡的老女人怎麼可能會有後代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，我對你們這類人真是喜歡不起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好，我今晚也沒打算再多交一個朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼別擔心，我不會在這裡久待。我知道自己的腦袋在其他雇傭兵眼裡有多值錢，所以完全不打算做慈善。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸彈......你果然還埋了更多炸彈。你這是......炸了從其他入口過來的路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同伴呢？他們不還在園區深處跟薩卡茲士兵們作戰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真好奇我的回答？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解釋前因後果很費時間，我可以告訴你結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——他們都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為把你撈出來很容易？信使小姐，我這幾個月勤勤懇懇在倫蒂尼姆拉攏的人手，大半都折在這破工廠裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......你最好別讓我虧太大。請問，現在能走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要再清點一下人數......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，南面廠房裡的人都逃出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，人真的有點太多了。我接受的任務可只有接你一個。記得跟凱爾希說，答應我的報酬要翻倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，帶上你的那個兜帽怪物，我們是時候——呃，你們愣著做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，前面的路是你炸的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不然呢？給我們的追兵留機會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，費斯特先生和他的小隊剛剛離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們去救人了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希爾，聯繫他們。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......都那麼大的人了，怎麼還會亂跑啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布萊克，前面情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解。繼續前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，左邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"深......深池......我要殺了你們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，最終殺死你的並不是深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又一個？這一路上倒了多少薩卡茲士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十六個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是深池幹的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，我不知道該怎麼說，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......深池幫我們省了不少力氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承認這一點並不可恥。你跟著我在薩迪恩區躲了多久了，布萊克？想要活下去，我們就得利用一切可以利用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，下一個是左邊這扇門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。接下來去右邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本，注意角落。我不希望敵人從走廊上冒出來給我們驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳......走開，魔族！我們......我們什麼都不會說的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到......哈哈......我們聽到了戰鬥的聲響，還看到了源石技藝的光......我還以為又是魔族想到了什麼新的折磨人的辦法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們受苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還能站起來嗎，士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵......很久沒聽到有人這麼叫我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼長官嗎？你來做什麼？你怎麼有臉站在這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼啊？我們是來救你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救我的？救我出去幹什麼？再被你們騙一次，然後死在你們跟異族人一起謀劃的下一個陰謀裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做夢去吧，“長官”！我們寧可死在這個審訊室裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本，舉起你的弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......號角？你這是要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來不想浪費彈藥。你知道的，我們的任何資源都很寶貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......他們是同胞，也曾是對維多利亞盡職盡責的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如死在這裡是他們最後的願望，那他們配得上我們的弩彈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的會殺了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會如願死在這陰暗的房間裡。倫蒂尼姆會將你遺忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到很多年後，這片老舊的廠房不再能引起任何人的興趣，腐爛的塵土會將你的白骨徹底掩藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以用我手上這把弩幹點別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿上它，跟我們一塊從這裡出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你或許還是能達成心願，很快就死在敵人的炮火下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在臨死前，你還來得及看一眼夜空，聞一聞充滿了鐵銹味和機油味的空氣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便想一想那些呼吸著同樣空氣的，你最希望能活下去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會記住你的付出。我會用我的生命擔保這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......是啊......他們可能還活著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想好了嗎？沒有多少猶豫的時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我武器，我跟你走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？你們也願意跟我們走嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。布萊克，你的小隊多了七......嗯，九個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵們，在出去之前，告訴我你們的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，聯繫上自救軍小隊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無人機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下啊......我好不容易才重啟了這個無人機......和那一個構造還不太一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們處境很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，你先帶著其他平民出去，自救軍三隊的人會在外面接......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我留下來的地雷都被引爆了！你知道這意味著什麼嗎？？你能想像一下有多少士兵在追我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了我的人，你們是不是還想逼我掏光炸藥的存貨啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"五分鐘。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們不能再耽擱了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們最多再等五分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，麻煩你儘快聯絡上費斯特先生。他和洛洛小姐還有五分鐘可以趕回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們也得投入戰鬥了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比爾，實話告訴我，你......你是不是變重了？我怎麼拖得這麼費力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......這樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還真輕了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼你新學的戲法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢，老弟，我只是......只是換了個姿勢......咳咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別別別，別換姿勢了，我怕你的傷變得更重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才我找到你的時候，看你流了那麼多血，我真怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怕我死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......那幫魔族佬，哪有那本事！也就是給我......按一下......按......哎呦......可真疼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就歇歇吧，別說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你找到出路了嗎？這些房間一定被薩卡茲改造過，繞得我頭昏眼花的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，就在幾分鐘前，我聽到了戰鬥的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想出口應該就在這附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了老比爾，你還是說點什麼吧，我真怕你就這樣睡過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次打了勝仗，你問我要了什麼獎勵，你還記得吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......水果罐頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼水果罐頭，你這傢伙，你說你要一個機器小磐蟹，下次見面的時候送給你那住在金融街的大侄女！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，我就是餓暈了......多虧你記性好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼記性好？那之後我可是好幾天沒睡覺，除了出任務就是給你做那玩意兒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易快做完了，你可得給我挺著，等回去了就趕緊拿走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......好......都聽你的，隊長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有腳步聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，隊長，薩卡茲——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們往哪裡走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到了嗎？地上有血。他們走不遠。追上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須趕緊走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我和你一塊扶著比爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要讓你們倆一起架著才能走，我可真丟人啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說這種話。比爾，你說的，我們是一家人。家人本來就應該互相幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長！他們追上來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強尼，儘量擋一會！加比，我給你的小榴彈，你都帶著吧？看準了就丟，我們需要點掩護——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你讓洛克十七繼續在前面找路，我們能不能跑掉，全靠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"右轉，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，右邊走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......剛才是誰在說話？洛克十七？你......你怎麼活了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是什麼弱智工程師笑話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我費了好大功夫才駭進了這個無人機的系統......別誤會，洛洛小姐，我沒加什麼料啊，完全是因為這個系統做得太簡單了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可露希爾小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對，是我，我沒機會給你的無人機裝我的語音素材，所以只能靠電子元件來模擬發聲了......唉，是不是沒那麼可愛啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......挺像你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們接下來怎麼走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左轉......不不不，左邊有薩卡茲，呃，我是說敵方薩卡茲！你們快往後——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後面敵人更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那我想想辦法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了對了，我們往上，往上走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，你們不是有會飛的那種裝置嗎？滑索，我是說滑索！你們上方有個通風口，應該夠一個人通過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是應該嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，我們有重傷患，要是出了錯，我們一個都走不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我需要洛洛小姐幫我控制下無人機......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說吧，我該怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛你......你這麼相信她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，或者你說吧，你有什麼更好的脫困方法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長！他們馬上就要過來了！我看到帶頭的薩卡茲了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，可露希爾小姐，洛洛，打開通風口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解！洛洛小姐，快瞄準！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克十七——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？打開了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再來一輪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機失準！這......隔得這麼遠，這一劍也能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到此刻才找到離開的路嗎？有些遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我攔著，你快走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盲目的勇氣在戰場上並不能發揮任何作用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強尼！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，通風口——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我沒有辦法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我來想辦法，我還有兩顆榴彈，就算是皮糙肉厚的薩卡茲也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？直接......劈開了榴彈？根本沒有炸開......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，這不是普通薩卡茲——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加比！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，我只不過是一名平平無奇的雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這種程度的話......你們真的想戰勝曼弗雷德，甚至特雷西斯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差太遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲......你以為，我做的只有幾顆榴彈嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的只有幾枚會冒煙的小道具，甚至連真正的榴彈都稱不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能炸開薩卡茲身體的炸彈，可不會長成這副樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特，洛洛，聽得到嗎？我幫你們重新校準了......但只有一次機會......抓緊啊，拜託啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！隊長，我們能上去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你帶著比爾，你先走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，你別想追上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會保護我的家人，你......你們別想再傷害他們，我不會讓你得逞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克十七！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機自爆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是......太微不足道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長......走......快走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，你告訴我，為了救一個戰友，搭上兩個......甚至可能更多戰友的性命，這樣的交換當真合理嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們臨死前，呼喚的最後一個人，都是隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你是否能背負起他們的犧牲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我寧可他們一個都不要死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，抓緊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次利用了滑索？很聰明，但是，還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些小伎倆......還並不足以讓你們在戰場上活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們馬上就會再見面的，不成熟的反抗軍戰士。你們不知道......你們根本不可能活著離開這座煉獄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，他們來了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——四分五十秒過去了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我幫你們倒數嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，費斯特先生，只有你們三個嗎？其他兩位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們回不來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐，我們必須馬上離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個薩卡茲追過來了，他很厲害，而且他們人很多，我們......我們被埋伏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了可露希爾小姐，否則我們一個都回不來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們知道我們會去，他們也知道你們在這裡，他們只是在等......這的確是個陷阱，我們再不走就來不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，已經來不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這是最後一個雷，也是最大的那一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"又是最後一個？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這是第幾個最後一個？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別煩我，{@nickname}，是的，我還有一個炸彈，你猜猜那是留給誰的？不用客氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很緊張？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"來的人很難對付？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你沒聽出來這爆炸的聲音一點都不對勁？啊，我知道了，你頭上的布罐頭底下根本就是空空如也。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你講個薩卡茲鬼故事吧，那傢伙根本沒有踩進我的陷阱。他不僅避開了，而且還巧妙地破壞了它們的源石結構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我再給你解釋一下嗎？是的，佈置這批地雷並沒有花掉我太多心思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，上一次做到讓我的雷全部啞火的人，是那個惹人厭的龍女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉不可能在這裡，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小兔子，你那是什麼表情？她不是應該在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，{@nickname}，你和凱爾希......真的該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該恭喜你，{@nickname}，就在剛剛，我決定讓你在我的待炸名單上排第二了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這可不是好消息。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"謝謝。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，我們還有許多資訊沒有同步。我們得先撤退......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......撤退？說得容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慶幸吧，來的人不是塔露拉，我沒有聞到那股德拉克火焰特有的自大的臭味。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"圍住這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——八隊九隊，去牆另一邊！封住那條路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼短的時間內就集結了這麼多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，博士，海蒂女士他們還沒撤走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，阿米婭小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先不要說這些。要說的話，我們也要等安全地回去以後再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，等一會我來......欸欸，W小姐，你、你抓著我幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你得留著點力氣。你看看還在這裡的人，工匠，傷患，廢物......還有哪個有戰鬥力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......這麼說也沒錯，但我們會盡力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不......咳咳......不拖後腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別了，我腿上這點肉還不夠你們扯的。省點力氣在逃跑上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我真的很不想說這句話。這完全不是我的作風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我需要那個海蒂活著。我得找到那個老女人，問清楚一些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你得讓開了。帶走你該帶的人，別留下任何不可燃垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要出事。我們會等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不走？是想讓我用炸彈再送你們一程？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......終於走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡說些奇怪的話，搞得像我們真是什麼親密戰友似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還要我繼續炸下去嗎？很快，這舞台就要不剩下什麼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這是什麼玩意兒？石子？你在開什麼劣質玩笑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，你惹到我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......我本來還想節儉一些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，乾脆點走出來，我順便答應讓你的屍體完整一些，不好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，好險，你距離砍中我也就只差兩顆炸彈的尺寸了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又成長了不少，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
